.TH AITERM 1 "2026-10-04" "aiterm 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aiterm \- turn a natural-language request into a shell command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aiterm
.RI [ flags ]
.RI "natural language request"
.br
.B aiterm
.B -version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aiterm
sends a request to an OpenAI-compatible chat-completions endpoint and displays the
suggested shell command. It does not run the command until you review it and enter
.BR y .
Model-generated commands can be wrong or destructive. Always inspect a command before
running it. Commands containing control or invisible characters are refused, and
multi-line commands are marked because every line runs when confirmed.
.PP
After a command is shown, the menu accepts these keys:
.TP
.B y
Run the displayed command.
.TP
.B c
Copy the command to the clipboard and exit. If no clipboard utility is available,
the command is printed instead.
.TP
.B g
Copy the command so you can edit it and run the edited version with
.BR aiterm .
.TP
.B r
Send a follow-up request with the current conversation context.
.TP
.B w
Send a new request without the previous conversation context.
.TP
.B q
Quit without running the command.
.PP
If a command fails, or you interrupt it with Ctrl-C, its exit status is printed and
the menu returns. On Linux, clipboard copying uses the first available command from
.BR xclip ,
.BR xsel ,
or
.BR wl-copy .
.SH OPTIONS
Options must appear before the request.
.TP
.BI -key " key"
API key. Defaults to
.BR OPENAI_KEY .
If neither is set, or the key is rejected, the program prompts for a key without
echoing it. Prefer the environment variable so the key is not stored in shell history
or exposed in the process list.
.TP
.BI -model " model"
Model to use. Defaults to
.B AITERM_MODEL
or
.BR gpt-4.1-mini .
.TP
.BI -timeout " duration"
Maximum time to wait for the API, for example
.B 30s
or
.BR 5m .
Defaults to
.B AITERM_TIMEOUT
or
.BR 2m .
.TP
.BI -url " url"
Chat-completions endpoint for an OpenAI-compatible API. Defaults to
.B AITERM_URL
or
.BR https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions .
.TP
.B -version
Print version information and exit.
.TP
.B -h
Print usage information and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B OPENAI_KEY
API key sent as a bearer token. It can be omitted when the program prompts for a key.
.TP
.B AITERM_MODEL
Default model; overridden by
.BR -model .
.TP
.B AITERM_TIMEOUT
Default API timeout; overridden by
.BR -timeout .
.TP
.B AITERM_URL
Default chat-completions endpoint; overridden by
.BR -url .
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success, including displaying the version or quitting from the menu.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime error.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error, such as a missing request.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
aiterm "find all Go files in this directory"
aiterm list the 10 largest files in this folder
AITERM_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1/chat/completions \\
  AITERM_MODEL=llama3.2 OPENAI_KEY=ollama aiterm "show disk usage"
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sh (1)
.PP
